  "ledger": [
    {"court": "Assyria", "entry": "T1: c5 Tattamaru sent with offer (Mari to me, Susa to Assyria, no rival bids, non-aggression, tablet). T2: Artessupa promised on Assyria's behalf no armies moved without word, exchange of envoys, and a tablet; nothing on Mari. I told him Mari is mine. Assyria took Terqa by force: not to be trusted. T2: I attacked Susa by force (Nippur, supported from Durkurigalzu), against my spoken word."},
