  "summary": "I am Burna-Buriash of Babylonia, start 2600, growth 1.43-1.64 (Arzawa 1.65 is the rival). Land: homeland five, plus Susa (taken T2, army there), bought walled Mari, Qadesh, Damascus (walled cities cannot hold my troops; defended by treaty only). Tablets: k6 Assyria (broken by me), k7 Mitanni (peace; Isuwa/Carchemish not mine; Mari mine), k26 Hatti sealed T5 (no army/fleet or bid against homeland or provinces held that day), k28 Mitanni sealed T6 (joint war on Assyria, no separate peace; Terqa/Ashur/Nineveh Mitanni, Arbela/Ekallatum/Susa me). Egypt: Sin-iqisham's clay put Damascus/Tyre/Byblos/Amurru in Egypt's sphere; I refused to seal; Egypt took Megiddo T4 and Tyre T5 (army in Tyre next to Damascus); c15 sent T6 with a mirror of k26. Assyria passive and mutually supporting (terqa holds, arbela and ashur support ekallatum). T5 strike bounced 2v2 and 1v1. Free city left: Amurru 200 (I bid T6). Growth engine: net income about +170/turn plus bought cities; conquests add 10x yield. Geometry: only Ekallatum touches Sippar and Dk; only Arbela touches Susa; empty-after-movement lets me raise an army where one just left.",
