    {"court": "Alashiya", "entry": "T3: c5 sent, spoken only: neither bids against the other in the Levant; they take Amurru, I Megiddo/Tyre (both lost to Egypt). T6: I bid Amurru 200 anyway (if they bid too, none sold, no gold lost). c5 returns about T7 with their answer."}
