{
  "notes": "T8: Terqa taken T7 (Assyria terqa army destroyed). Kidin-Adad swears Babylon strikes Ekallatum+Arbela THIS season (joint blow); Babylon did hit Arbela from Susa in T7 (bounced), so it is not empty talk. I use the moment: terqa -> ashur, nineveh supports it, taidu supports nineveh holding (hold 2 vs arbela+ashur 2 = bounce), washukanni holds (capital: only isuwa touches it, 1v1 bounces). If Babylon's blows cut arbela/ekallatum supports, Ashur (hold 1) falls to my 2. If Assyria supports Ashur, I bounce at no cost. Only bad case: nineveh support cut by arbela AND ashur+ekallatum hit terqa with 2 (unlikely). Raised an army in harran (empty; levy happens after movement, so if Hatti walks in nothing is raised or paid). k12 (Hatti homelands) ends about T10; Ubaru (c7) is at Hatti with a peace to T16, back about T9; c8 back from Egypt about T9. T9 PLAN: read results. If Ashur is mine: harran army -> terqa to refill, keep nineveh supported. If bounced: keep the defence (terqa supported by washukanni, nineveh by taidu, harran army holds), try again when Babylon's strikes land. Do not feed Babylon (leader): never support its moves into Arbela/Ekallatum unless it clears Ashur's way. Never reveal k15/k22 or the Hatti peace to Babylon.",
